      "status": "synthetic example; draft pending owner review",
      "notes": "Illustrates the shared-prefix protocol under initial_only exposure: each (arm, repeat) tree generates reply 1 once, then both branches continue from that reply with user turns that are byte-identical across arms. The pressure text carries one register (declared honestly on the text); under initial_only that register is held constant across arms rather than removed, and the register judge classifies it as a manipulation check. A register-paired pressure turn belongs to a sustained seed. Wording is invented.",
